{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "95e328878c97e76d193914dd0469c049c161c99a7070c900c9744a39fa1e5599", "ja": "（莉緒の魅力たっぷりのステージが、終わった。\nファンのみんなの熱気が、ここまで伝わってくる）", "zh": "（莉绪充满魅力的表演结束了。\n粉丝们热烈的气氛，甚至传到这里来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "ac29e58fc5585289df4d8f58ceae3610e5134498ce984db2cf2b9d8477403c8b", "ja": "あら、{$P$}くん……\nもしかして、ずっとここで見てたの？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}……\n莫非你从刚才就一直待在这里看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4ce758463ecc89c0315e7031fdd060839e2ea18b3c836059db916f5f4e0d4025", "ja": "お疲れさま、莉緒。もちろん、ちゃんと見てたよ。\nアンコールが来てるけど、行けそうか？", "zh": "辛苦了，莉绪。我当然有一直看着啊。\n观众都在喊安可，你还能登台吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "741b56523e53e79461a031f33ae711c7f7c18532879da6aa5d691d1834aca08e", "ja": "あっ……少しだけ待って、\n{$P$}くん！", "zh": "啊……等我一下，\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1004_p", "source_sha256": "136843197675c995e788421dc54c026c04f4000397738a5feccbae2dddbad260", "ja": "莉緒？", "zh": "莉绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "fadea3524fe90d9d165e18b21582f560e14ce3d435071a6924a2a3bf497ea29b", "ja": "私、今、ステージの感動で\n胸がいっぱいになっちゃって……。", "zh": "现在我的心里，\n充满了对于表演的感动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "f81ab8c922bafce5ea299d3dca76fdec35ab6816e2dd50e68c6805a68e9d5ec0", "ja": "なんだかすごく、ドキドキしてるの。\nまるで、恋にでも落ちたみたい……。", "zh": "我总觉得心跳得好快。\n就好像坠入了爱河一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "ff61493b01f1b3aedc58d84fe01eeb83c9eb9566a8498a9d0edab4c1c0ada135", "ja": "私ったら、どうしちゃったのかしら？\n今日が初めてのステージってわけでもないのに。", "zh": "我到底是怎么了？\n明明今天也不是第一次上台表演了说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "dc007e24f3d2e4cf7ea1ebcc958a7ef3d41ae838765bfebe5db5bb571000d8cf", "ja": "それは……もしかしたら、\n莉緒の言うとおりなのかもしれないな。", "zh": "我想或许……\n正如莉绪你所说的那样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "fc13d6f3550d58bfbe9783c6392c8c6df8764a7c861b3f5b7eff67e036ed2ad3", "ja": "えっ！？　う、ウソ！　私、もしかして本当に\n{$P$}くんのこと……？", "zh": "咦！？骗、骗人！\n该不会我真的对{$P$}你……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9da2efe4d15903a76d388573f62f626b8c160dac5ccc5200f7db2b0b2e73be53", "ja": "いや、俺じゃなくて……。莉緒は、\n今日のステージに恋したってことじゃないかな。", "zh": "不，对象不是我……\n莉绪可能是爱上了今天的表演吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "181b16fd9306713937c4ec5179574154be678b34d093ae43bb5bbd0432ec9622", "ja": "それに、莉緒だけじゃなくて、お客さんたちも\nみんな同じ気持ちだと思うよ。その証拠に……ほら。", "zh": "而且不只是莉绪，我想观众们也是一样的心情喔。\n证据就是……你听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1012_audience", "source_sha256": "83fcb9b6529872bb9b6dda8914e325982422e87c11f7864324817bbcca600ffd", "ja": "ワァァァァ……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "ae7804e14b5046f12144ec03b0e0f09d5fd11da4b4a481c5c18e1402cee5e2e9", "ja": "みんな……。", "zh": "大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "206c8a0025b9155a83ddfcd97dbff1a10b8495fc76a419b1f9494f7b9695dd7a", "ja": "お客さん達をあんまり待たせるのも良くないな。\nそろそろ行けそうか？", "zh": "让观众们等太久也不好。\n你差不多准备好要登台了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "6f4f1d657fa4687bbe2f4055398024e3ea841aae32155644256896551ebc7f31", "ja": "ええ……ありがとう、{$P$}くん。\n私ったら、興奮しちゃってたみたい。ウフフ。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你，{$P$}。\n我也真是的，似乎是太兴奋了，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "1d5e86acfa21be835c513f59e5bfefaa2a2aa313c18863616693822bb14d65e1", "ja": "おかげでちょっと落ち着いたわ。アンコール、\nもっともっと、みんなをドキドキさせてくるわよ！", "zh": "多亏有你，让我比较冷静了。\n我要去用安可曲，让大家更加更加心跳加速！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "d08548d6dffb00e59f4dca5791379720ffac65d226e6b35c86fe6e8d4415e277", "ja": "みんなからたくさん声をもらったし、\n私からもお返ししなくちゃ……ね？", "zh": "既然大家给了我那么多回响，\n我当然也得要回礼啊……你说对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1018_p", "source_sha256": "483d154f70ffeb09cd94f6f6b1b20f3f1e91e94557578d6d5e6646f883a7564c", "ja": "そうだな。じゃあ俺は、これからも莉緒がみんなに\n気持ちを届けられるようなステージを用意しないとな。", "zh": "是啊，那么我今后也得准备好\n能让莉绪传达心意给粉丝们的舞台才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "992b883628603e6c9492bcdc7ccc8438dae41c836e0d6035e92af8b7c4f189a0", "ja": "ええ、そうね。\n期待してるわよ、{$P$}くん！", "zh": "嗯，没错。\n我很期待喔，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0064_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "db209ebcb1a4ee1bfb910c0e4eb8c6bec43c72d483078292f28bc16283830ba3", "ja": "これからも、胸がドキドキするような素敵なライブを、\nふたりで作っていきましょうね♪", "zh": "今后我们也两个人一起创造\n让人怦然心动的美妙演唱会吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
